    "html": "<p>A wheel, initially at rest, is rotated with constant angular acceleration and completes <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\"></span> full revolutions in <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> seconds.</p>\n<p>What is the angular acceleration of the wheel?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.4\\;  \\textup{rad s}^{-2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.8\\;  \\textup{rad s}^{-2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.4 \\pi\\;  \\textup{rad s}^{-2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.8 \\pi\\;  \\textup{rad s}^{-2}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
